# Scene2-4-5

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐4‐5
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:17_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『湖方面』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我和蕾雅为了找到典狱长，<br>穿过森林，朝着湖的方向走去。|#0204Adv05_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 軽く水がはねる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_156 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，我们听到湖的方向传来水花四溅的声音。|#0204Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:湖那边有动静……！|#0204Adv05_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，那也许就是典狱长。|#0204Adv05_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到水声后，我们加快脚步，<br>但迎接我们的却是意想不到的人物。|#0204Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ミリア立ち絵なし
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:95 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR10
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@EmoteJump ActorIds:Miria Loop:false Speed:1
@Wait WaitMode:0.4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:120 IdAndAppearance:Miria
@HideAllCharacters Duration:0.2 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:小蕾，还有小希！？<br>哇啊啊啊～|#0204Adv05_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正在湖中洗澡的米莉亚慌乱不已，<br>连忙躲到树荫下。|#0204Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吓、吓吓吓死我了……！<br>没想到居然会有人来……|#0204Adv05_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你是穿着衣服下水的，<br>我是觉得没有必要躲起来……|#0204Adv05_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不是啦，明明是个大叔，还在湖里玩闹，<br>这幅样子被看到了，有点害羞……|#0204Adv05_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你可不是大叔吧？|#0204Adv05_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然不是真的大叔啦……<br>不对，不是这个问题……|#0204Adv05_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:算啦算啦，希罗。<br>展现出平时不曾示人的一面，<br>确实需要一点勇气。|#0204Adv05_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，这真是出人意料啊。<br>米莉亚确实不像是会这么开心玩闹的人。<br>|#0204Adv05_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……昨天和小莉一起玩了以后啊，<br>大叔我深刻体会到，<br>为了减轻精神压力，有时候换换心情真的很重要。|#0204Adv05_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以偶尔在湖里痛快地游一场<br>也不错吧～？|#0204Adv05_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我实在无法理解，<br>为何她敢踏入这片深不见底的诡异湖泊……|#0204Adv05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我们都是受雪莉的影响而开始行动的，<br>这点不仅是米莉亚，我和蕾雅也一样。|#0204Adv05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我这么想着的时候——|#0204Adv05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:在湖对岸的稍远处，<br>能看见典狱长正在飞来。|#0204Adv05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗！是典狱长！<br>我们追！|#0204Adv05_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……看来只能上了。|#0204Adv05_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 水に飛び込む音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_145 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ここからレイアとヒロの立ち絵なし
; ========================================

; 水に飛び込むエフェクト
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:我们不得不跃入湖中。|#0204Adv05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我们判断，游过去比绕路更快。|#0204Adv05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（湖水比想像中深……）|#0204Adv05_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:幸好湖水干净清澈，<br>还不至于令人不适……|#0204Adv05_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:然而，我隐约在水下<br>瞥见了一个诡异的影子。|#0204Adv05_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（什么东西……？）|#0204Adv05_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我——|#0204Adv05_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:跟在那个影子的后面|#0204Adv05_Choice001| Lock:false ButtonPath:ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:Act02_Chapter04/Act02_Chapter04_Bad02 ResetState:-

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:无视了那个影子|#0204Adv05_Choice002| Lock:false AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:.Choice2-4-2
