# Choice2-4-2

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:22

[PrintTextModified Text:现在还是追典狱长比较重要。<br>我选择无视那个影子。|#0204Adv05_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:——然而，当我们游到对岸时，<br>典狱长早已消失无踪。|#0204Adv05_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆泳いだ息切れ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊，哈啊，哈啊……可恶。|#0204Adv05_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆泳いだ息切れ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:结果我们也全身湿透了啊……|#0204Adv05_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是好奇我们的举动，<br>米莉亚也游到了对岸。|#0204Adv05_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR10
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:既然都湿透了……不如我们三个一起玩水，如何？|#0204Adv05_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:全身湿透的我们对视了一眼……|#0204Adv05_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:最终决定，<br>就当作稍事休息，尽情玩水吧。|#0204Adv05_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:阳光透过树叶洒在湖面上，波光粼粼，<br>微小的涟漪随我们的动作扩散。|#0204Adv05_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们互相泼水……<br>自由游泳……<br>难得地尽情玩闹了一番。|#0204Adv05_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:微风吹来青草的芳香，混合着湖水的清凉气息，<br>令人心旷神怡。|#0204Adv05_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

